  solution          : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Enabled : Computer Configuration\Policies\Administrative Templates\Windows Components\Cloud Content\Turn off cloud consumer account state content Note: This Group Policy path may not exist by default. It is provided by the Group Policy template CloudContent.admx/adml that is included with the Microsoft Windows 11 Release 21H2 Administrative Templates (or newer). Impact: Users will not be able to use Microsoft consumer accounts on the system, and associated Windows experiences will instead present default fallback content."
