  solution          : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to <path>\<file name>.log : Where <path> is the location and <file> is the log name specified by the organization. Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security\Windows Defender Firewall with Advanced Security\Windows Defender Firewall Properties\Public Profile\Logging Customize\Name Impact: The log file will be stored in the location and file specified by the organization."
