<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0812 - MSSRV - (L1) Ensure Network security: Configure encryption types allowed for Kerberos is set to AES128_HMAC_SHA1, AES256_HMAC_SHA1, Future encryption types"
