<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0826 - MSSRV - (L1) Ensure Interactive logon: Smart card removal behavior is set to Lock Workstation or higher"
  info            : "This policy setting determines what happens when the smart card for a logged-on user is removed from the smart card reader."
