</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0827 - MSSRV - (L1) Ensure Microsoft network client: Digitally sign communications (always) is set to Enabled"
  info            : "This policy setting determines whether packet signing is required by the SMB client component."
